    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36354" root="قوت" body-key="q">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلَانٌ يَتَقَوَّتُ بِكَذَا</span></b>  [<i>Such a one feeds, nourishes,</i>
or <i>sustains, himself with such a thing</i>], (S, O,) or
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِالقَلِيلِ</span> [<i>with that which is little</i>]: (Msb:) or
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تقّوت بِالشَّىْءِ</span> <i>he made the thing his</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُوت</span> [or <i>food</i>];
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِهِ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اقتات</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اقتاتهُ</span></b>  signify thus likewise:
(TA:) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِهِ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اقتات</span></b>  signifies <i>he ate it;</i> (Msb;)
and so does ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اقتاتهُ</span></b> . (TA.)

